1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,884
Five things you must never do in Eritrea.

2
00:00:03,084 --> 00:00:04,486
Don't change money on the street.

3
00:00:04,686 --> 00:00:09,162
It is illegal, so use official offices and
keep your receipt.

4
00:00:09,362 --> 00:00:11,312
Don't count on cards or ATMs.

5
00:00:11,511 --> 00:00:15,555
They do not work for foreigners, so bring
enough cash in crisp US dollars.

6
00:00:15,755 --> 00:00:18,417
Don't photograph military or government
sites.

7
00:00:18,617 --> 00:00:21,856
You risk a warning, a confiscated phone,
or arrest.

8
00:00:22,055 --> 00:00:23,679
Don't go near the borders.

9
00:00:23,879 --> 00:00:26,974
Landmines remain, and tensions with
Ethiopia are high.

10
00:00:27,174 --> 00:00:29,965
And don't visit the tank graveyard without
a permit.

11
00:00:30,165 --> 00:00:31,982
Even inside the capital, it needs one.

